[ti:Coffee (đoạn học)]
[ar:Josh Woodward]
[by:SingLearn - Nhom 10 (faster-whisper small alignment)]
[00:02.40]A cup of coffee in the morning and I get the paper
[00:07.92]I check the headlines and decide that I am bored
[00:12.90]I check my email and decide to answer later
[00:17.82]Another cup of coffee and I drag myself to work
[00:24.10]My life is grounded in a firm routine
[00:27.38]Of coffee, sleep and work
[00:29.24]I am not boring, I just stick to what I know
[00:43.72]I'm sitting there at work and I realized I forgot to wake up
[00:49.20]Can't be productive when I'm dreaming 'bout a sheep
[00:53.64]I go upstairs and get myself another cup of coffee
[00:58.76]I get downstairs and then I spill it on the floor
[01:05.07]My life is grounded in a firm routine
[01:08.30]Of coffee, sleep and work
[01:10.20]I am not boring, I just stick to what I know
[01:14.40]
